<title>BRAZIL: Brazil sells dlrs at 1.0615 in commercial tender.</title>
<headline>Brazil sells dlrs at 1.0615 in commercial tender.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Central Bank sold dollars at 1.0615 reais each in an auction in the commercial foreign exchange market, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction increased liquidity of the market and helped some banks to square off their positions at the end of the day, they added.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
